materials as it sees fit.  I think newspapers have the right to refuse to
accept ads that are misclassified (which is very different from allowing
newspapers to place ads where they see fit).  These are totally outside
the public forum discussion.  Library shelves and newspaper classifieds
are not government established public forums.


