that forum does not make it a private forum.  The fact that messages are 
carried along from machine to machine does not make it a private forum, either. 
From its inception, Usenet was designed to be freely available to anyone.  The 
fact that its inception stretches back to UUCP does not mean it was designed to 
serve only two sites. That argument is as ludicrous as most of your comments.  
UUCP was used to reach more than two machines with mail, news, etc. I see no 
reason to go into the transmission mechanisms of UUCP, etc.

