jugglers... more interested in keeping this act from crashing to the
ground than in seeing how many hunks of processed meat we can keep in
the air at one time.  You, on the other hand, keep trying to plant a
big banner amongst all us jugglers accusing us of discriminating
against particular food products while hinting that this may be because
those food products are derived from our relatives.  Don't complain if
your banner acquires a few holes from assorted flying objects.  You
are in the wrong place at the wrong time.

     As someone else has already suggested, if you want a net with
unlimited free expression, go start one.  Usenet ain't it.

